   "body": "Unblocked (steward ext/opus-helper1, 2026-10-29): dependencies LOT-048 (#74), LOT-031 (#58) are merged; the `status: blocked` label was stale. Board: #324.\n\nOpen to outside contributors: `external: ready` added.\n\n**Reading list** (all on `dev-swift`):\n- [AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/AGENTS.md)\n- [docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md)\n- [docs/agents/LESSONS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/LESSONS.md)\n- [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- [docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md) (quote prefill, captures `R41a`, `R41b`, `R42`, `R47a`, `R47c`)\n- [docs/FIXTURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FIXTURES.md)\n- Dependency specs: [LOT-048](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-048-post-form-engine.md) (post-form engine; it leaves the multi-quote cookie clean-up after a quoting reply to this lot), [LOT-031](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-031-message-actions.md) (per-message action links, `QuoteSelectionToken`)\n\n**Routing** (docs/LOTS.md): HFRClient, difficulty medium, priority medium, Opus → Fable (author Opus-tier, reviewer Fable-tier).\n\n**Rules**\n- The claimer writes `docs/lots/LOT-049-*.md` first (AGENTS.md §5): legacy sources (file:line), inputs/outputs, edge cases, intentional differences, *pending capture* states.\n- The adversarial review may be run by another agent of yours with a different model; for a state-changing flow, sessions, auth, cookies, tokens or HFRModels public types (EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md §7) it must come from another contributor. Check §7 against the multi-quote cookie before you decide.\n- The steward merges for contributors without write access.\n- Lots delivered by outside contributors are listed for the final Fable audit (#326).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
